        <mxCell id="c10" value="skill_node (A)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;로봇을 만지는 유일한 노드&lt;br&gt;DSR 워커 스레드 1개 — 직렬&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Action 서버 6&lt;br&gt;  move_to_station · scoop · pour&lt;br&gt;  weigh_container · weigh_held · return_material&lt;br&gt;Service 서버 6&lt;br&gt; set_gripper · measure_force · safe_pose&lt;br&gt; restore_grip · recover_safety · emergency_stop&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;발행: gripper_state · event(NUDGE)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F5FA;strokeColor=#5F6980;fontColor=#161B2A;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
